      "content": "thanks for the draft. it's a good start but i just ran it through our sentiment tool and the score was pretty low—only like a 0.3. it's a bit too dry/clinical for what we need. \n\ncan you try another version that hits a higher sentiment score? like, we need more of that emotional connection to get people to open their wallets. just remember what i said though—don't let it get weird or sounds like a soap opera. it just needs to feel more moving/optimistic about the impact a donor can make. maybe lean a bit more into the beauty of the reefs and the hope of the restoration?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
